              <p>Hi Creators,</p>
<p>Nick and Tian here. We are excited to share the Spring 2024 edition of the <a href="http://create.roblox.com/roadmap">Creator Roadmap</a>, showcasing the progress made on a number of launches that shipped this year, including <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/secrets-store-general-availability/2892154">Secret Store</a>, <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/new-audio-api-beta-elevate-sound-and-voice-in-your-experiences/2848873">Audio API (Beta)</a>, and <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/open-cloud-engine-api-for-updating-scripts-beta/2836619">Open Cloud Engine API for Scripting</a>, which sought to address some of the top creator needs. Along with this, we introduced some exciting AI-powered solutions like <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/texture-generator-beta/2880635">Texture Generator</a>, <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/avatar-auto-setup-alpha/2880686">Avatar Auto-Setup</a>, and <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/in-experience-text-chat-translations/2823894">Automatic Chat Translations</a>. With your help, these features are already changing the landscape of the platform for the better. For instance, since chat translations launched, we’ve already translated nearly <a href="https://s27.q4cdn.com/984876518/files/doc_news/2024/Mar/18/roblox-introduces-ai-powered-avatar-and-texturing-technologies-to-accelerate-3d-creation.pdf">20B messages</a>!</p>
<p>For a full list of launched features, click <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/creator-roadmap-spring-2024-edition/2946605#features-launched-this-year-3">here</a>.</p>
<p>Over the past few weeks, we’ve <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/opening-up-marketplace-to-more-creators/2931299">opened up Marketplace creation</a> to more creators, and <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/creator-store-buy-and-sell-plug-ins-with-real-world-currency/2923445">launched a revamped Creator Store </a>that provides 100% net proceeds to creators. We know these are major changes to our ecosystem, and we’re committed to iterating on these products to ensure they deliver value to our community.</p>
<h3>
<a name="h-2024-quality-and-performance-1" class="anchor" href="#h-2024-quality-and-performance-1"></a>2024: Quality and performance</h3>
<p>There are many upcoming product features to celebrate, but we first want to reiterate that we’re extremely focused on quality and performance. In the past year, we closed or responded to 3300 bugs and counting—one of our key focus areas. Among other things, we plan to make major headway on Studio hangs this year.</p>
<p>We also continually work to make the user platform as stable and performant as possible. While we provide automatically scalable systems that perform well on all platforms, we see the highest quality results when our creators help optimize their content. Therefore, we’re improving our developer-enabled performance tools, such as updating <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/new-features-in-scriptprofiler/2838140">Script Profiler</a> and<a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/introducing-the-luau-vm-memory-exploration-tools/2808362"> improving memory tooling</a>, which make it easier for creators to optimize their own experiences.</p>
<h3>
<a name="upcoming-roadmap-2" class="anchor" href="#upcoming-roadmap-2"></a>Upcoming roadmap</h3>
<p>We’ve updated the Creator Roadmap with our revised roadmap and removed any features launched in 2023. Following up on <a href="https://blog.roblox.com/2024/04/hunt-first-edition-helping-us-plan-future-roblox-wide-events/">The Hunt: First Edition</a>, we are excited about future events. We’ve added specific roadmap items for points of interest and events, allowing creators to define key areas in their experiences. We plan to unlock the discovery of events later this year. We’re also working on a number of enhancements to the engine, including native code generation, type isolation, and improved haptics, while also continuing to iterate and improve the Studio experience with completely revamped asset management and much more!</p>
<p>Click <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/creator-roadmap-spring-2024-edition/2946605#new-roadmap-items-8">here</a> to see what else we’ve added to the roadmap.</p>
<p>Be on the lookout for updates regarding our next installment of the Creator AMAs, where we’ll discuss everything monetization and economy-related.</p>
<p>Happy creating! <img src="https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/tada.png?v=12" title=":tada:" class="emoji" alt=":tada:" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20"></p>
<p>Nick &amp; Tian</p>
<hr>
