<h3>
<a name="new-roadmap-items-8" class="anchor" href="#new-roadmap-items-8"></a>New roadmap items</h3>
<details>
<summary>
Click to expand</summary>
<h4>
<a name="create-how-you-want-9" class="anchor" href="#create-how-you-want-9"></a>Create how you want</h4>
<p>Easy creation, optimized for your ideal workflows</p>
<ul>
<li>Improved Package Discoverability and Update Workflow: Easily discover package actions and apply updates.</li>
<li>Dragger Improvements: Improved controls, guides, and measurements for draggers.</li>
<li>DragDetectors for UI: Make UI in your experience draggable and interactive without scripting.</li>
<li>Builder font released.</li>
<li>Content Importer: Creating a streamlined single importer that enables users to import all their content easily.</li>
</ul>
<p>Engine can support any type of experience</p>
<ul>
<li>Native Code Generation: Improves script performance on RCC and in Studio plugins by compiling Luau to host CPU instructions instead of interpreting bytecodes in a virtual machine.</li>
<li>Updated Type Solver: This improves Luau script analysis including more accurate binary operators inferences and new type operators.</li>
<li>DataModel Isolation and Script Capabilities: The ability to insert models with scripts into experiences and have those scripts isolated from modifying the world or accessing Roblox APIs that are not explicitly allowed—making it safer to use models shared by other developers, guaranteeing configurable packages are limited to themselves, and empowering in-experience creation, including scripting, without impacting server state.</li>
<li>Type Inference for Native Compilation: Incorporating types added by Luau into the decisions made by native code generation will allow more optimizations to be performed and reduce the size of the generated native code.</li>
<li>Immersion Mode for VR: Support for tracked controllers in VR that animate avatar arms in real-time.</li>
<li>Improved Haptics Controls: Improved API for adding haptics to your experiences and UI across all supported platforms.</li>
</ul>
<p>Create rich and lifelike worlds</p>
<ul>
<li>Audio Meta Data API: Developer-facing API to help developers add audio metadata to their experiences.</li>
</ul>
<p>Cloud creation improves collaboration and reliability</p>
<ul>
<li>Comments &amp; Annotations inside Studio: Annotate and leave comments in Studio for your collaborators.</li>
</ul>
<p>Avatar Creation and Marketplace</p>
<ul>
<li>Marketplace search and recommendations: Improve Marketplace search and recommendations to create a more seamless shopping experience.</li>
<li>R6 to 15 Conversion Tool: Streamline the conversion of existing R6 experiences to R15 with tools to migrate characters, animations and scripts.</li>
</ul>
<h4>
<a name="grow-and-engage-your-audience-10" class="anchor" href="#grow-and-engage-your-audience-10"></a>Grow and engage your audience</h4>
<p>Roblox Home page connects you to your ideal audience</p>
<ul>
<li>Thumbnail Personalization: You can A/B test your thumbnails to optimize your conversion.</li>
<li>Improved Experience Details Page: We’re updating the Experience Details Page to improve usability and conversion. We’re adding the experience icon to mobile experience pages and showing improved insights about the experience to help users decide better.</li>
<li>Points of Interest &amp; Events: We’re working on helping you drive the discovery of events and key places in your experience</li>
</ul>
<p>Powerful search and browse capabilities</p>
<ul>
<li>Unified Search Result Page: Improved ranking of experiences, people, marketplace items inside search result page and ranking them based on their relevance to the user query regardless of content type</li>
<li>Clickbait suppression: Detecting misleading and clickbait content and decreasing user exposure.</li>
</ul>
<h4>
<a name="benefit-from-a-growing-creator-ecosystem-11" class="anchor" href="#benefit-from-a-growing-creator-ecosystem-11"></a>Benefit from a growing creator ecosystem</h4>
