                  </time>
                  <meta itemprop='dateModified' content='2024-04-26T18:01:32Z'>
              <span itemprop='position'>18</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class='post' itemprop='text'>
              <p>Roblox also does not fully polish or quality control new features either, many features have been pushed which are extremely buggy resulting in huge downtime and major game-breaking bugs.</p>
<p>Updates are also known to break existing features, their quality control is frustratingly bad…</p>
            </div>

